OL,3,GNEWSA'Bumper year' for whale and
OL,4,Adolphin sightings
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarine experts on the Isle of Man had a
OL,7,Fbumper year of whale and dolphin
OL,8,Fsightings this year, describing it as
OL,9,Fthe best since 2010.
OL,11,F"We've had an absolute abundance of
OL,12,Fthem," Jen Adams, from Manx Whale and
OL,13,FDolphin Watch, said.
OL,15,FAlmost 100 sightings have been reported
OL,16,Fto the charity so far, compared to
OL,17,Fabout 20 last year and eight the year
OL,18,Fbefore.
OL,20,F"It has gone up massively," said Adams,
OL,21,Fthe charity's outreach and education
OL,22,Fmanager.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
